{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Vanessa Breaks up With Marco", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Never Again", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 12, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe characteristics of different people and their jobs.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "What Are Idioms?", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Idioms are expressions which have a meaning apart from what the words themselves mean.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "They are very common in spoken English. It is important to know some idioms and to remember that the meaning of the words as a group is different from the words individually. Here are some idioms:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Idiom \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" He was drinking like a fish.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" He was drinking a lot of alcohol.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Actions speak louder than words. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You can judge people better based on what they do rather than what they say.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" The ball is in your court. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The next decision is yours.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Don't judge a book by its cover. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Don't judge someone based only on their appearance.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Hit the nail on the head. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do or say something exactly right.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "&nbsp;", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "More About The Past Continuous Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "There are some general rules to remember when you use the Past Continuous tense.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The word <span class=\"strong\">while </span> usually comes before the Past Continuous clause.  The word  <span class=\"strong\">when</span> usually comes before the Past tense.  ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">While we were ordering</span>, she kept giving him flirty looks. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">When the bill came</span>, he was looking at me like I had to pay for it. ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to run into", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to meet someone unexpectedly", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: We ran into his ex-girlfriend.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to describe someone.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "cheapskate ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who does not like to spend money", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: He is such a cheapskate!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "flirty ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "acting like you are attracted to someone ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She was being very flirty with him.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "speechless ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "unable to speak because of shock or surprise ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I couldn't believe it - I was speechless!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "pushy ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "forceful; wanting others to follow your opinion ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He became really pushy.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "obnoxious", "type": "name"}, {"content": " loud and rude ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He was very obnoxious at the restaurant.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to yell ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to talk very loudly at someone", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: He was yelling at his ex-girlfriend.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob02aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Write a short story (8-10 sentences).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write about a situation that happened in the past.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use the Past Continuous and Simple Past tenses.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use adjectives to make your story interesting.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Check your spelling and grammar.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read it to your partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write a story with 8-10 sentences.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I describe a past situation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use adjectives to make my story interesting.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read it to my partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le12ob02re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn5le12ob02re2img06.jpg", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn5le12ob02re2img06.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: So, you ran into his ex-girlfriend ... what happened next?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: She was the waitress!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh no!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: While we were ordering, she kept giving Marco flirty looks. He was drinking like a fish, too!"}, {"image": "engenn5le12ob02re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "14000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Ugh, that's terrible! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Mmhmm ... when the bill came, he was looking at me like I had to pay for it.  I was completely speechless.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What a cheapskate!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It's too bad, because the food was exquisite. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What a waste!"}, {"image": "engenn5le12ob02re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "time": "29500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: He became really pushy while we were leaving the restaurant and tried to get his ex's attention.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What was he doing?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: He was yelling and acting really obnoxious.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I can't believe it! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Then his ex-girlfriend came out and started yelling at him, calling him all sorts of names.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What happened next?"}], "coverimg": "engenn5le12ob02re2img06.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "_dat